# Inline uniform block binding.
#
# Asserts the descriptor is bound as VK_DESCRIPTOR_TYPE_INLINE_UNIFORM_BLOCK, not as a
# plain UBO. The pbr shader still produces a blank frame (FS/PS=0) because it needs real
# material and geometry data -- that is scene data, the same class as the FAIL_BLACK
# samples, not a binding defect. This test covers the binding capability only.
#
# REQUIRES: vulkan, gpu, corpus, glslang
# RUN: %csrun %repo/tests/lit/Inputs/corpus/inline_uniform.yaml --backend vulkan --no-show --format json --vendor-counters off --no-benchmark | grep -qi "inline uniform"
